  "label": "The cartoon character is mapped as 'a little savage'",
  "description": "The text 'thats a little savage' is directly juxtaposed with the visual of the cartoon character dressed in stereotypical Native American attire. The meme uses this visual to analogically map the character onto the derogatory concept of 'savage', invoking a harmful racial stereotype. The character's dynamic pose and the drum reinforce the implied aggression or brutality associated with the term 'savage'.",
